{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:50 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"元朗萬芊24小時內上樓書 部署推洋房招標\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3aed3baf7bcbdb9af9ae284fdc30a844/2026-10/KF_ANQI_-_2026-10-22T155127_078.png\"/>\n<p>長實發展的元朗萬芊，預告將於24小時內公布樓書，下周開放展銷廳予指定人士參觀，首批將招標推洋房應市。</p>\n<p>長實營業部副首席經理楊桂玲指出，項目自上周公布命名後，市場反應熱烈，當中不乏2房及3房洋房戶查詢，有見及此，部署將於24小時內公布樓書，最快下周開放展銷廳予指定人士參觀，首批將率先以招標形式推售洋房。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ea9d204046f2012fafe091570bd521a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_46_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"長實元朗錦泰路項目萬芊（Montage）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df4bdefc1cf91c58d00f05880c8a1461/2026-10/PB260712WA05.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c099da2f616fcfd8bffd4ccf4cd3d106/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_47_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15bdfb4798a8a8ba5dfbf54d39bd669a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_46_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d0cc5fc3874a061b366ae39bf266120/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_47_45.jpeg\"/>\n<p>長實高級助理營業經理劉佩珊指出，項目園林及會所名為「Club Montage」，面積逾4萬方呎，擁四大主題設計，設逾20項多元設施，包括人寵共融空間、健身室、戶外健身空間及宴會廳等。</p>\n<p>相關文章：元朗萬芊最快周內上樓書 先推洋房招標</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:04:58.617116+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:54:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:49.427878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:58:08.399185+00:00","content_hash":"ddd7443c23329f249ef5f8901ccfebffb8005a6b7c2c05d2062eb8d3e00af15b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}